            "review_title": "Review at Thuy Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Benny8388\nSingapore, Singapore160 contributions\n3\nYummy deep fried soft shell crabs in HCM City\nJul 2019 • Friends\nNot sure correct address not. Anyway I attached the name card.\nThe fried fried soft shell is very good. Very crispy and juicy. The crab meat with glass noodles so so. The crab meat too dried. So are the spring rolls. Even thought perfectly deep fried but the fillings are too dry. I ate it with the papaya/ carrot sauce and the taste is much better.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 27, 2019",
